de.",category:"Marketplace",gradient:"from-neutral-600 to-neutral-800",initials:"TK",startedFrom:"Couldn't get a cab in Paris",photo:"/founders/travis-kalanick.jpg"},{name:"Su Hua",company:"Kuaishou",app:"Kuaishou",year:2011,metric:"$33B",metricValue:33e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"400M+",downloadsValue:4e8,journey:"Built a GIF maker that evolved into China's second-largest short video platform. Kuaishou's mobile-first approach reached 400M+ monthly active users and IPO'd at $160B.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-orange-400 to-red-500",initials:"SH",startedFrom:"GIF maker turned short video giant",photo:"/founders/su-hua.jpg"},{name:"Nikolay Storonsky",company:"Revolut",app:"Revolut",year:2015,metric:"$75B",metricValue:75e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"65M+",downloadsValue:65e6,journey:"Former Credit Suisse trader frustrated by foreign exchange fees. Built a mobile banking app that now serves 65M customers across 48 countries.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-indigo-500 to-purple-600",initials:"NS",startedFrom:"Frustrated by bank FX fees",photo:"/founders/nikolay-storonsky.jpg"},{name:"Tony Xu",company:"DoorDash",app:"DoorDash",year:2013,metric:"$77B",metricValue:77e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Stanford MBA student who couldn't get food delivered. Built DoorDash from a Stanford dorm. Now dominates North American food delivery.",category:"Delivery",gradient:"from-red-500 to-rose-600",initials:"TX",startedFrom:"Stanford dorm, couldn't get delivery",photo:"/founders/tony-xu.jpg"},{name:"David Vélez",company:"Nubank",app:"Nubank",year:2013,metric:"$60B",metricValue:6e4,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"130M+",downloadsValue:13e7,journey:"Colombian-born, Stanford-educated. Frustrated by Latin American banking fees. Built Nubank into the world's largest digital bank with 130M+ customers.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-purple-500 to-violet-600",initials:"DV",startedFrom:"Hated Latin American bank fees",photo:"/founders/david-velez.jpg"},{name:"Vlad Tenev",company:"Robinhood",app:"Robinhood",year:2013,metric:"$69B",metricValue:69e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"Bulgarian-born Stanford grad. Democratized stock trading with zero-commission mobile trades. Sparked the retail investing revolution.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-emerald-500 to-teal-600",initials:"VT",startedFrom:"Wanted to democratize trading",photo:"/founders/vlad-tenev.jpg"},{name:"Fred Lalonde",company:"Hopper",app:"Hopper",year:2007,metric:"$5B",metricValue:5e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Canadian entrepreneur who spent years on travel data before going mobile-only. Hopper has zero web presence — the app uses AI to predict prices and has 100M+ downloads.",category:"Travel",gradient:"from-violet-400 to-purple-500",initials:"FL",startedFrom:"Years of data, then mobile-only bet",photo:"/founders/fred-lalonde.jpg"},{name:"Chris Britt",company:"Chime",app:"Chime",year:2013,metric:"$25B",metricValue:25e3,metricLabel:"Peak Valuation",downloads:"20M+",downloadsValue:2e7,journey:"Believed everyone deserves access to banking without fees. Built the largest US neobank with 22M+ customers and no physical branches.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-lime-500 to-green-600",initials:"CB",startedFrom:"Fee-free banking for everyone",photo:"/founders/chris-britt.jpg"},{name:"Jan Koum",company:"WhatsApp",app:"WhatsApp",year:2009,metric:"$22B",metricValue:22e3,metricLabel:"Acquired by Meta",downloads:"2B+",downloadsValue:2e9,journey:"Ukrainian immigrant. Applied to Facebook and got rejected. Built WhatsApp with one co-founder. Sold it to Facebook for $22B.",category:"Messaging",gradient:"from-green-500 to-emerald-600",initials:"JK",startedFrom:"Rejected by Facebook",photo:"/founders/jan-koum.jpg"},{name:"Anthony Tan",company:"Grab",app:"Grab",year:2012,metric:"$17B",metricValue:17e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"300M+",downloadsValue:3e8,journey:"Harvard Business School student who wanted safer taxis in Malaysia. Built Southeast Asia's leading super app for rides, food, and payments.",category:"Marketplace",gradient:"from-green-500 to-lime-500",initials:"AT",startedFrom:"Harvard student, safer Malaysian taxis",photo:"/founders/anthony-tan.jpg"},{name:"Igor & Dmitry Bukhman",company:"Playrix",app:"Gardenscapes",year:2004,metric:"$16.8B",metricValue:16800,metricLabel:"Combined Net Worth",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Two brothers from Vologda, Russia. Started making casual games as teenagers. Playrix is now the largest mobile game developer in Europe.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-orange-400 to-red-500",initials:"PX",startedFrom:"Casual games from Vologda, Russia",photo:"/founders/dmitry-bukhman.jpg"},{name:"Brian Kim",company:"Kakao",app:"KakaoTalk",year:2010,metric:"$19B",metricValue:19e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"300M+",downloadsValue:3e8,journey:"Built South Korea's dominant messaging app that 93% of the population uses. Kakao expanded into payments, gaming, mobility, and entertainment.",category:"Messaging",gradient:"from-yellow-400 to-amber-500",initials:"BK",startedFrom:"Messaging for South Korea",photo:"/founders/brian-kim.jpg"},{name:"Ilkka Paananen",company:"Supercell",app:"Clash of Clans",year:2010,metric:"$8.6B",metricValue:8600,metricLabel:"Acquired by Tencent",downloads:"500M+",downloadsValue:5e8,journey:"Finnish startup with 6 people. Built Clash of Clans. $10B+ lifetime revenue from one game. 290M monthly active players across all titles.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-blue-500 to-cyan-500",initials:"IP",startedFrom:"6-person team in Helsinki",photo:"/founders/ilkka-paananen.jpg"},{name:"Whitney Wolfe Herd",company:"Bumble",app:"Bumble",year:2014,metric:"$8.5B",metricValue:8500,metricLabel:"Peak IPO Valuation",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Left Tinder and built Bumble, where women make the first move. Became the youngest female CEO to take a company public in the US.",category:"Dating",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-pink-500",initials:"WH",startedFrom:"Left Tinder, started over",photo:"/founders/whitney-wolfe-herd.jpg"},{name:"Evan Spiegel",company:"Snap Inc.",app:"Snapchat",year:2011,metric:"$8.4B",metricValue:8400,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"750M+",downloadsValue:75e7,journey:"Stanford student. Turned down $3B from Zuckerberg at 23. Took Snap public and pioneered ephemeral messaging, Stories, and AR filters.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-yellow-400 to-amber-500",initials:"ES",startedFrom:"Stanford dorm room project",photo:"/founders/evan-spiegel.jpg"},{name:"Sean Rad",company:"Match Group",app:"Tinder",year:2012,metric:"$7B",metricValue:7e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"500M+",downloadsValue:5e8,journey:"Built Tinder as a side project inside a startup incubator. The swipe mechanic changed dating forever. Match Group now owns Tinder, Hinge, and OkCupid.",category:"Dating",gradient:"from-rose-500 to-pink-500",initials:"SR",startedFrom:"Side project in a startup incubator",photo:"/founders/sean-rad.jpg"},{name:"Luis von Ahn",company:"Duolingo",app:"Duolingo",year:2011,metric:"$5B",metricValue:5e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"500M+",downloadsValue:5e8,journey:"Guatemalan professor who invented CAPTCHA and reCAPTCHA. Built Duolingo to give free language education to the world. Its owl mascot became a global meme.",category:"Education",gradient:"from-green-400 to-lime-500",initials:"LA",startedFrom:"CAPTCHA inventor, free education mission",photo:"/founders/luis-von-ahn.jpg"},{name:"Riccardo Zacconi",company:"King",app:"Candy Crush Saga",year:2012,metric:"$5.9B",metricValue:5900,metricLabel:"Acquired by Activision",downloads:"3B+",downloadsValue:3e9,journey:"Started with browser games. Pivoted to mobile. Candy Crush became the most downloaded game in App Store history. Acquired by Activision Blizzard.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-purple-500 to-violet-600",initials:"RZ",startedFrom:"Browser games company pivot",photo:"/founders/riccardo-zacconi.jpg"},{name:"Simón Borrero",company:"Rappi",app:"Rappi",year:2015,metric:"$5.25B",metricValue:5250,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Colombian entrepreneur who built Latin America's everything-delivery super app. Rappi delivers food, groceries, cash, and even love letters across 9 countries.",category:"Delivery",gradient:"from-orange-500 to-amber-500",initials:"SB",startedFrom:"Everything-delivery for Latin America",photo:"/founders/simon-borrero.jpg"},{name:"Samuel Albin",company:"Moon Active",app:"Coin Master",year:2011,metric:"$5B",metricValue:5e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"200M+",downloadsValue:2e8,journey:"Built Coin Master in Tel Aviv. A simple slot-machine-meets-village-building game that grosses over $100M per month. Proof that simple mechanics win.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-yellow-500",initials:"SA",startedFrom:"Simple game idea from Tel Aviv",photo:"/founders/samuel-albin.jpg"},{name:"Tom Blomfield",company:"Monzo",app:"Monzo",year:2015,metric:"$5B",metricValue:5e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"10M+",downloadsValue:1e7,journey:"Built GoCardless first, then started Monzo to reinvent banking with a mobile-first approach. The hot coral card became a status symbol in the UK.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-rose-400 to-rose-600",initials:"TB",startedFrom:"Wanted to reinvent UK banking",photo:"/founders/tom-blomfield.jpg"},{name:"Logan Green",company:"Lyft",app:"Lyft",year:2012,metric:"$5B",metricValue:5e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"UC Santa Barbara student inspired by Zimbabwe's minibus culture. Co-founded Zimride, then pivoted to Lyft. Proved ridesharing could be friendly and community-driven.",category:"Marketplace",gradient:"from-pink-500 to-purple-500",initials:"LG",startedFrom:"Inspired by Zimbabwe minibuses",photo:"/founders/logan-green.jpg"},{name:"Vijay Shekhar Sharma",company:"Paytm",app:"Paytm",year:2010,metric:"$8B",metricValue:8e3,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"300M+",downloadsValue:3e8,journey:"Son of a schoolteacher from a small Indian town. Built Paytm into India's largest mobile payments platform. India's demonetization in 2016 sent the app viral overnight.",category:"Fintech",gradient:"from-blue-400 to-indigo-500",initials:"VS",startedFrom:"Schoolteacher's son, small-town India",photo:"/founders/vijay-shekhar-sharma.jpg"},{name:"Saeju Jeong",company:"Noom",app:"Noom",year:2008,metric:"$3.7B",metricValue:3700,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"Korean-born entrepreneur who lost his grandfather to preventable disease. Built Noom to change health behavior through psychology, not just calorie counting.",category:"Health",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-orange-500",initials:"SJ",startedFrom:"Lost grandfather to preventable disease",photo:"/founders/saeju-jeong.jpg"},{name:"Robert Antokol",company:"Playtika",app:"Slotomania",year:2010,metric:"$3.7B",metricValue:3700,metricLabel:"Market Cap",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Israeli entrepreneurs who saw the potential of social casino games on mobile. Playtika's portfolio generates $2.5B+ annual revenue from casual mobile games.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-violet-500 to-purple-600",initials:"RA",startedFrom:"Social casino games bet",photo:"/founders/robert-antokol.jpg"},{name:"Mudassir Sheikha",company:"Careem",app:"Careem",year:2012,metric:"$3.1B",metricValue:3100,metricLabel:"Acquired by Uber",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"McKinsey consultant who saw the need for reliable rides in the Middle East. Built Careem into the region's leading ride-hailing app. Acquired by Uber for $3.1B.",category:"Marketplace",gradient:"from-emerald-400 to-green-500",initials:"MS",startedFrom:"McKinsey consultant, Middle East rides",photo:"/founders/mudassir-sheikha.jpg"},{name:"Kevin Systrom",company:"Instagram",app:"Instagram",year:2010,metric:"$2.9B",metricValue:2900,metricLabel:"Net Worth",downloads:"2B+",downloadsValue:2e9,journey:"Built Instagram with 13 employees. Sold to Facebook for $1B in 18 months. Instagram now generates $20B+ in annual revenue for Meta.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-pink-500 via-red-500 to-yellow-500",initials:"KS",startedFrom:"Photo filter app, 13 employees",photo:"/founders/kevin-systrom.jpg"},{name:"Soner Aydemir",company:"Dream Games",app:"Royal Match",year:2019,metric:"$2.7B",metricValue:2700,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"200M+",downloadsValue:2e8,journey:"Turkish game developer. Left Peak Games, founded Dream Games with ex-colleagues. Royal Match earns $1.4B/year with a single puzzle game. Turkey's most valuable startup.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-red-500",initials:"SA",startedFrom:"Left Peak Games with ex-colleagues",photo:"/founders/soner-aydemir.jpg"},{name:"Luca Ferrari",company:"Bending Spoons",app:"Remini",year:2013,metric:"$2.55B",metricValue:2550,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"500M+",downloadsValue:5e8,journey:"Built a mobile app empire from Milan. Bending Spoons’ portfolio includes Remini, Splice, and 30 Day Fitness — 500M+ downloads total. Then acquired Evernote and Meetup.",category:"Photo",gradient:"from-indigo-400 to-blue-500",initials:"LF",startedFrom:"Mobile app empire from Milan",photo:"/founders/luca-ferrari.jpg"},{name:"Oscar Pierre",company:"Glovo",app:"Glovo",year:2015,metric:"$2.3B",metricValue:2300,metricLabel:"Acquired by Delivery Hero",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"23-year-old Spanish engineering student who wanted anything delivered in minutes. Built Glovo into a multi-category delivery app across 25 countries.",category:"Delivery",gradient:"from-yellow-500 to-green-500",initials:"OP",startedFrom:"23-year-old engineering student",photo:"/founders/oscar-pierre.jpg"},{name:"Alexandre Yazdi",company:"Voodoo",app:"Helix Jump",year:2013,metric:"$2B",metricValue:2e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"6B+",downloadsValue:6e9,journey:"French publisher that mastered the hyper-casual game formula. Voodoo's portfolio has been downloaded over 6 billion times. Acquired BeReal for $600M.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-500",initials:"AY",startedFrom:"Mastered hyper-casual game formula",photo:"/founders/alexandre-yazdi.jpg"},{name:"Sidar Sahin",company:"Peak Games",app:"Toon Blast",year:2010,metric:"$1.8B",metricValue:1800,metricLabel:"Acquired by Zynga",downloads:"200M+",downloadsValue:2e8,journey:"Turkish entrepreneur who built a mobile gaming powerhouse in Istanbul. Toon Blast and Toy Blast dominated puzzle charts. Sold to Zynga for $1.8B.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-fuchsia-500 to-pink-600",initials:"SS",startedFrom:"Gaming powerhouse from Istanbul",photo:"/founders/sidar-sahin.jpg"},{name:"Hovhannes Avoyan",company:"PicsArt",app:"PicsArt",year:2011,metric:"$1.5B",metricValue:1500,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"150M+",downloadsValue:15e7,journey:"Armenian engineer who wanted to democratize creativity. Built PicsArt into one of the top 20 most-downloaded apps ever with AI-powered photo editing.",category:"Photo",gradient:"from-purple-500 to-pink-500",initials:"HA",startedFrom:"Armenian engineer, democratize creativity",photo:"/founders/hovhannes-avoyan.jpg"},{name:"Manish Chandra",company:"Poshmark",app:"Poshmark",year:2011,metric:"$1.2B",metricValue:1200,metricLabel:"Acquired by Naver",downloads:"80M+",downloadsValue:8e7,journey:"Indian-American engineer who noticed people had closets full of clothes they never wore. Built a social marketplace for secondhand fashion.",category:"E-commerce",gradient:"from-rose-400 to-pink-500",initials:"MC",startedFrom:"Closets full of unworn clothes",photo:"/founders/manish-chandra.jpg"},{name:"Dmitry Gurski",company:"Flo Health",app:"Flo",year:2015,metric:"$1B",metricValue:1e3,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"300M+",downloadsValue:3e8,journey:"Belarusian entrepreneur who built the world's most popular period and fertility tracking app. Flo has 300M+ downloads and 60M monthly active users.",category:"Health",gradient:"from-pink-400 to-rose-500",initials:"DG",startedFrom:"Health tracking for women",photo:"/founders/dmitry-gurski.jpg"},{name:"Alex Zhu",company:"Musical.ly → TikTok",app:"Musical.ly",year:2014,metric:"$1B",metricValue:1e3,metricLabel:"Acquired by ByteDance",downloads:"100M+",downloadsValue:1e8,journey:"Chinese entrepreneur who built a lip-syncing app for teens. Musical.ly became the #1 app in the US. ByteDance acquired it and merged it into TikTok.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-violet-400 to-purple-500",initials:"AZ",startedFrom:"Lip-syncing app for teens",photo:"/founders/alex-zhu.jpg"},{name:"Samo Login",company:"Outfit7",app:"Talking Tom",year:2009,metric:"$1B",metricValue:1e3,metricLabel:"Acquired",downloads:"18B+",downloadsValue:18e9,journey:"Slovenian husband-and-wife team who invested $250K to build a talking cat app. Talking Tom reached 18B+ downloads — the most downloaded mobile game franchise ever.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-yellow-500",initials:"SL",startedFrom:"$250K investment, talking cat app",photo:"/founders/samo-login.jpg"},{name:"Ehud Shabtai",company:"Waze",app:"Waze",year:2006,metric:"$966M",metricValue:966,metricLabel:"Acquired by Google",downloads:"150M+",downloadsValue:15e7,journey:"Israeli hacker frustrated with traffic. Built a community-driven GPS app where drivers share real-time road data. Google acquired Waze for $966M.",category:"Navigation",gradient:"from-teal-500 to-cyan-600",initials:"ES",startedFrom:"Frustrated with Israeli traffic",photo:"/founders/ehud-shabtai.jpg"},{name:"Talmon Marco",company:"Viber Media",app:"Viber",year:2010,metric:"$900M",metricValue:900,metricLabel:"Acquired by Rakuten",downloads:"500M+",downloadsValue:5e8,journey:"Israeli-born entrepreneur who built a WhatsApp competitor focused on voice calls. Viber reached 500M+ users and was acquired by Japan's Rakuten for $900M.",category:"Messaging",gradient:"from-purple-400 to-violet-500",initials:"TM",startedFrom:"WhatsApp competitor focused on voice",photo:"/founders/talmon-marco.jpg"},{name:"Mikael Hed",company:"Rovio",app:"Angry Birds",year:2009,metric:"$775M",metricValue:775,metricLabel:"Acquired by Sega",downloads:"5B+",downloadsValue:5e9,journey:"Rovio's 52nd game was the one that worked. Angry Birds became a global franchise with movies, theme parks, and merch. Acquired by Sega in 2023.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-red-500 to-rose-600",initials:"MH",startedFrom:"52nd game attempt",photo:"/founders/mikael-hed.jpg"},{name:"Gabe Leydon",company:"Machine Zone",app:"Game of War",year:2008,metric:"$600M/yr",metricValue:600,metricLabel:"Peak Revenue",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"Built Game of War: Fire Age from a small studio. At peak, it earned $1.5M per day. Spent $40M on a Super Bowl ad with Kate Upton. Defined the mobile strategy genre.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-stone-500 to-stone-700",initials:"GL",startedFrom:"Small studio, massive ambition",photo:"/founders/gabe-leydon.jpg"},{name:"Alexis Barreyat",company:"BeReal",app:"BeReal",year:2020,metric:"$600M",metricValue:600,metricLabel:"Acquired by Voodoo",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"French entrepreneur frustrated by Instagram's fakeness. Built an app that prompts one unfiltered photo per day. Went viral with Gen Z. Acquired by Voodoo for $600M.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-neutral-600 to-neutral-800",initials:"AB",startedFrom:"Frustrated by Instagram's fakeness",photo:"/founders/alexis-barreyat.jpg"},{name:"Joel Flory",company:"VSCO",app:"VSCO",year:2011,metric:"$550M",metricValue:550,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"200M+",downloadsValue:2e8,journey:"Photographer and artist who wanted filters that looked like real film. VSCO became the photo editor of choice for creators before Instagram copied its aesthetic.",category:"Photo",gradient:"from-slate-400 to-slate-600",initials:"JF",startedFrom:"Photographer who loved film aesthetics",photo:"/founders/joel-flory.jpg"},{name:"Andy Puddicombe",company:"Headspace",app:"Headspace",year:2010,metric:"$500M",metricValue:500,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"70M+",downloadsValue:7e7,journey:"Former Buddhist monk who spent 10 years in monasteries. Partnered with a marketer to bring meditation to the masses via a mobile app. Netflix series followed.",category:"Wellness",gradient:"from-orange-400 to-amber-400",initials:"AP",startedFrom:"Former Buddhist monk, 10 years in monasteries",photo:"/founders/andy-puddicombe.jpg"},{name:"Dennis Crowley",company:"Foursquare",app:"Swarm",year:2009,metric:"$400M",metricValue:400,metricLabel:"Valuation",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"NYU grad who was obsessed with check-ins. Built Foursquare to gamify real-world exploration. Pioneered location-based social networking before anyone else.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-blue-500 to-purple-500",initials:"DC",startedFrom:"Obsessed with location check-ins",photo:"/founders/dennis-crowley.jpg"},{name:"Will Shu",company:"Deliveroo",app:"Deliveroo",year:2013,metric:"$3.9B",metricValue:3900,metricLabel:"Acquired by DoorDash",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"American investment banker in London who couldn't get good food delivered. Built Deliveroo in the UK. Acquired by DoorDash in 2025 to expand globally.",category:"Delivery",gradient:"from-teal-400 to-emerald-500",initials:"WS",startedFrom:"Banker in London, no good delivery",photo:"/founders/will-shu.jpg"},{name:"Keith Shepherd",company:"Imangi Studios",app:"Temple Run",year:2011,metric:"1B+",metricValue:500,metricLabel:"Downloads",downloads:"1B+",downloadsValue:1e9,journey:"Husband-and-wife team with one artist. Built Temple Run from their apartment. Hit 1 billion downloads as a 3-person studio.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-emerald-500 to-teal-600",initials:"KS",startedFrom:"3-person team, built from apartment",photo:"/founders/keith-shepherd.jpg"},{name:"Shainiel Deo",company:"Halfbrick Studios",app:"Fruit Ninja",year:2001,metric:"1B+",metricValue:500,metricLabel:"Downloads",downloads:"1B+",downloadsValue:1e9,journey:"Australian game studio that spent years making small games. Fruit Ninja's simple swipe mechanic hit 10M downloads in its first year. Now at 1B+ total.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-red-400 to-orange-500",initials:"SD",startedFrom:"Aussie studio, years of small games",photo:"/founders/shainiel-deo.jpg"},{name:"Dong Nguyen",company:"dotGEARS",app:"Flappy Bird",year:2013,metric:"$50K/day",metricValue:18,metricLabel:"Peak Daily Ad Revenue",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"Solo developer from Hanoi. Made Flappy Bird in a few days. Earned $50K per day at peak. Pulled it from the App Store because it was too addictive.",category:"Gaming",gradient:"from-green-400 to-lime-500",initials:"DN",startedFrom:"Solo dev, built in a few days",photo:"/founders/dong-nguyen.jpg"},{name:"Nick D'Aloisio",company:"Summly → Yahoo",app:"Summly",year:2011,metric:"$30M",metricValue:30,metricLabel:"Sold to Yahoo at 17",downloads:"500K+",downloadsValue:5e5,journey:"Taught himself to code at 12. Built an AI news summarizer at 15. Sold to Yahoo for $30M at 17. Youngest person to receive venture capital in tech.",category:"News",gradient:"from-cyan-400 to-blue-500",initials:"ND",startedFrom:"Self-taught coder, age 12",photo:"/founders/nick-daloisio.jpg"},{name:"Justin McLeod",company:"Hinge",app:"Hinge",year:2012,metric:"26%",metricValue:15,metricLabel:"Revenue Growth YoY",downloads:"50M+",downloadsValue:5e7,journey:"Built Hinge as the dating app 'designed to be deleted.' Revenue grew 26% year-over-year in 2025. Proved that optimizing for relationships, not addiction, is a business model.",category:"Dating",gradient:"from-neutral-600 to-stone-700",initials:"JM",startedFrom:"Dating app designed to be deleted",photo:"/founders/justin-mcleod.jpg"},{name:"Zach Yadegari",company:"Cal AI → MyFitnessPal",app:"Cal AI",year:2023,metric:"$50M/yr",metricValue:50,metricLabel:"Revenue at 19",downloads:"15M+",downloadsValue:15e6,journey:"Built Cal AI in high school — snap a photo, get calories. $50M revenue run rate, 15M+ downloads. Acquired by MyFitnessPal in March 2026 at age 19. Second exit — sold his first company at 16.",category:"Health",gradient:"from-green-400 to-emerald-500",initials:"ZY",startedFrom:"High school, AI calorie counting",photo:"/founders/zach-yadegari.jpg"},{name:"Nikita Bier",company:"Gas",app:"TBH → Gas",year:2017,metric:"$100M+",metricValue:100,metricLabel:"Two Apps Sold",downloads:"10M+",downloadsValue:1e7,journey:"Built TBH, hit #1 on the App Store, sold to Facebook in 9 weeks. Built Gas, hit #1 again, sold to Discord. The serial mobile app builder.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-pink-400 to-rose-500",initials:"NB",startedFrom:"Built two #1 apps, sold both",photo:"/founders/nikita-bier.jpg"},{name:"Blake Anderson",company:"Umax / Plug AI",app:"Umax",year:2023,metric:"$15M/yr",metricValue:15,metricLabel:"Revenue at 23",downloads:"10M+",downloadsValue:1e7,journey:"Learned to code using ChatGPT. Built Umax (AI appearance analyzer) and Plug AI (dating text assistant). $15M annual revenue from his mobile app portfolio at 23. No CS degree.",category:"Entertainment",gradient:"from-violet-400 to-indigo-500",initials:"BA",startedFrom:"Learned to code with ChatGPT",photo:"/founders/blake-anderson.jpg"},{name:"Alex Slater",company:"QUITTR",app:"QUITTR",year:2024,metric:"$250K/mo",metricValue:12,metricLabel:"Revenue at 19",downloads:"1.5M+",downloadsValue:15e5,journey:"19-year-old British founder. Built QUITTR in 10 days with $3K. A digital wellness app that hit $250K/month revenue in 5 months and 1.5M downloads across 120 countries.",category:"Wellness",gradient:"from-cyan-400 to-teal-500",initials:"AS",startedFrom:"Built in 10 days with $3K",photo:"/founders/alex-slater.jpg"},{name:"Matt Moss",company:"Locket",app:"Locket",year:2022,metric:"90M+",metricValue:13,metricLabel:"Downloads",downloads:"90M+",downloadsValue:9e7,journey:"Built Locket in 14 days as a birthday gift for his girlfriend. Released on New Year’s Day 2022. Hit #1 on the App Store within days. 90M+ downloads, backed by Sam Altman and Instagram’s co-founder.",category:"Social",gradient:"from-amber-400 to-pink-400",initials:"MM",startedFrom:"Birthday gift for his girlfriend",photo:"/founders/matt-moss.jpg"}],c={Social:"bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-400 border-blue-500/20",Messaging:"bg-green-500/15 text-green-400 border-green-500/20",Gaming:"bg-red-500/15 text-red-400 border-red-500/20",Marketplace:"bg-neutral-500/15 text-neutral-400 border-neutral-500/20",Dating:"bg-pink-500/15 text-pink-400 border-pink-500/20",News:"bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-400 border-cyan-500/20","Social → AI":"bg-violet-500/15 text-violet-400 border-violet-500/20",Fintech:"bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/20",Delivery:"bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-400 border-orange-500/20",Travel:"bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-400 border-sky-500/20",Music:"bg-purple-500/15 text-purple-400 border-purple-500/20",Health:"bg-lime-500/15 text-lime-400 border-lime-500/20",Education:"bg-indigo-500/15 text-indigo-400 border-indigo-500/20","E-commerce":"bg-amber-500/15 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/20",Design:"bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 border-teal-500/20",Photo:"bg-fuchsia-500/15 text-fuchsia-400 border-fuchsia-500/20",Productivity:"bg-slate-500/15 text-slate-400 border-slate-500/20",Navigation:"bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 border-teal-500/20",Fitness:"bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-400 border-orange-500/20",Wellness:"bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-400 border-sky-500/20",Fashion:"bg-pink-500/15 text-pink-400 border-pink-500/20",AdTech:"bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-400 border-blue-500/20",Crypto:"bg-yellow-500/15 text-yellow-400 border-yellow-500/20",Entertainment:"bg-rose-500/15 text-rose-400 border-rose-500/20"};function u({founder:e,rank:o}){return(0,t.jsxs)("div",{className:"group relative a